sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C1 as Client 1
    participant C2 as Client 2
    participant C3 as Client 3
    participant C4 as Client 4
    participant S as AI Server

    Note over C1, S: Initial Burst
    C1->>S: Request
    C2->>S: Request
    S-->>C1: 200 OK
    S-->>C2: 200 OK
    Note over C1: ✅ Done
    Note over C2: ✅ Done

    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over S: 🔴 Rate Limit
        C3->>S: Request
        S-->>C3: 429 Too Many Requests
        Note over C3: ❌ Error - IDLE

        %% C4->>S: Request
        %% S-->>C4: 429 Too Many Requests
        Note over C4: ❌ Error - IDLE

    end

    %% This creates the visual "Empty Space"
    Note over C3, S: Exponential Backoff Period ...<br/>Server becomes ready, but Clients are still idle

    C3->>S: Retry Request
    S-->>C3: ...
